WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.829
Watch and read: For your describing practice, choose a describing word for the mango.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.073
The answer is: yellow. A describing word tells us more about an object.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:15.218
Watch and read: For your conversation practice, your friend is speaking about school.

00:00:15.218 --> 00:00:16.859
What is the best answer?

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.714
The answer is: Listen and wait your turn. Read the instruction carefully and choose

00:00:22.714 --> 00:00:24.505
the helpful or correct response.
